        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">NULLWAKE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NullWake is a psychological horror game about isolation, uncertainty, and the slow collapse of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in an abandoned hospital.<br>The building feels familiar, almost safe — until small details begin to feel wrong.<br>Lights flicker. Corridors stretch longer than they should.<br>The world does not break all at once. It erodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073560/extras/df2ae9b1b68a9a8ec60fb1b870743162.avif?t=1785834596\" width=1560 height=790 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you move forward, the environment changes around you.<br>A deserted town. Empty streets. Mannequins standing where no one should be.<br>Locations blend together, as if different worlds are overlapping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NullWake does not explain everything.<br>It lets you notice what should not exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear here is not constant — it waits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073560/extras/52f960ba2c8ebb7c82ae60ccf041c42c.avif?t=1785834596\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073560/extras_big/52f960ba2c8ebb7c82ae60ccf041c42c.webp?t=1785834596 width=1560 height=893 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ATMOSPHERE OVER ACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The horror in NullWake is built on tension, silence, and expectation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are moments where nothing happens.<br>Those moments are intentional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies do not follow predictable rules.<br>Sometimes the safest option is to stop moving.<br>Sometimes stopping is the worst choice you can make.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A FRAGMENTED STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is told through environments, visual clues, and subtle changes in the world.<br>Not everything you see can be trusted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality shifts slowly, and the game never tells you exactly when it happens.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror focused on atmosphere and tension<br>Multiple interconnected locations<br>Unpredictable enemy behavior<br>Environmental storytelling<br>A slow, oppressive pacing inspired by classic horror experiences</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NullWake is not loud.<br>It does not rush you.<br>It waits for you to realize that something is wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And by then, it is already too late.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">NULLWAKE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NullWake is a psychological horror game about isolation, uncertainty, and the slow collapse of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in an abandoned hospital.<br>The building feels familiar, almost safe — until small details begin to feel wrong.<br>Lights flicker. Corridors stretch longer than they should.<br>The world does not break all at once. It erodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073560/extras/df2ae9b1b68a9a8ec60fb1b870743162.avif?t=1785834596\" width=1560 height=790 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you move forward, the environment changes around you.<br>A deserted town. Empty streets. Mannequins standing where no one should be.<br>Locations blend together, as if different worlds are overlapping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NullWake does not explain everything.<br>It lets you notice what should not exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear here is not constant — it waits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073560/extras/52f960ba2c8ebb7c82ae60ccf041c42c.avif?t=1785834596\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073560/extras_big/52f960ba2c8ebb7c82ae60ccf041c42c.webp?t=1785834596 width=1560 height=893 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ATMOSPHERE OVER ACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The horror in NullWake is built on tension, silence, and expectation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are moments where nothing happens.<br>Those moments are intentional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies do not follow predictable rules.<br>Sometimes the safest option is to stop moving.<br>Sometimes stopping is the worst choice you can make.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A FRAGMENTED STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is told through environments, visual clues, and subtle changes in the world.<br>Not everything you see can be trusted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality shifts slowly, and the game never tells you exactly when it happens.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror focused on atmosphere and tension<br>Multiple interconnected locations<br>Unpredictable enemy behavior<br>Environmental storytelling<br>A slow, oppressive pacing inspired by classic horror experiences</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NullWake is not loud.<br>It does not rush you.<br>It waits for you to realize that something is wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And by then, it is already too late.</p>",
